    component, reference or condition mentioned in the authored requirement should
    you inspect first? Explain your reasoning."
  prediction: "For \u2018Repair all three faults and retest\u2019, what result or
    observation would you expect if the required setup is correct? Distinguish a
    predicted result from a measured result."
  practice: "In Level 94, perform the objective \u2018Repair all three faults and
    retest\u2019 in the actual game laboratory. Compare fresh evidence against: Diagnose
    the open V05, incorrect R2 value and Q1 bridge. Isolate power for each repair
    and verify a fresh run.\nThe mission evaluator decides completion; this tutorial
